      <div class="card">
        <span class="program-tag">Half-day</span>
        <h3>Introduction to Reversal</h3>
        <p>An overview of how lifestyle disease develops and how it reverses. Suitable for anyone curious about the SHARAN approach.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="program-tag">Weekend</span>
        <h3>Plant-Based Kitchen</h3>
        <p>A two-day intensive that gets your kitchen, pantry and weekday meal plan in shape — practical, hands-on, immediately useful.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="program-tag">Talk</span>
        <h3>Public Health Talks</h3>
        <p>Free and low-cost talks for community groups, companies, schools and hospitals. Get in touch to arrange one in your city.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="program-tag">Online</span>
        <h3>Live Webinars</h3>
        <p>Recurring live sessions on focused topics — gut health, hormones, sleep, ageing well, raising plant-based children.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="program-tag">Corporate</span>
        <h3>Workplace Wellness</h3>
        <p>Programs and talks designed for HR teams who want to invest in real, measurable employee health — not just step counts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
